WEBVTT

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:02.520
The opponent report

00:00:03.220 --> 00:00:04.990
Who are you playing tonight?

00:00:05.990 --> 00:00:10.560
Before the game, the opponent report: their record, their rank, their form.

00:00:11.560 --> 00:00:14.670
Your chances of winning, based on the league results.

00:00:15.670 --> 00:00:17.410
Their most-used pitchers.

00:00:18.410 --> 00:00:24.110
And if you tracked their batters, the report reminds you where each one hits. You show up informed.

00:00:25.310 --> 00:00:29.520
BaseballLineup. Less paperwork, more baseball.
